{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26248","headline":"寒食城南即事因访蓝田韦明府 · 殷尧藩","name":"寒食城南即事因访蓝田韦明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲出城南禁火天，路傍骑马独摇鞭。\n青松古墓伤碑碣，红杏春园羡管弦。\n徒说鸊鹈膏玉劒，漫夸蚨血点铜钱。\n世间尽是悠悠事，且饮韦家冷酒眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}